WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.735 --> 00:00:04.334
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Stonehenge is <b>older than</b> the Pyramids.

2
00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:08.582
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Brazil is <b>wetter than</b> Ireland.

3
00:00:10.234 --> 00:00:14.323
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> New York is <b>more expensive than</b> Paris.

4
00:00:15.449 --> 00:00:19.269
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> My new job is <b>better than</b> my old one.

5
00:00:21.032 --> 00:00:24.827
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> The traffic is always <b>worse</b> in the evening.